## Interpretation

The ranking is an area-weighted PLR view of the selected ICON D2
forecast partition. Population figures are shown only where the
population source record passed the project's quality gate.

Rejected population records remain in the final analytical dataset with
explicit status and reason fields instead of being imputed as zero.
